### picons info
GET http://picons.vuplus-support.org/picons/picon_info.txt

### channels
GET http://vuuno4kse/api/getservices?sRef=1:7:1:0:0:0:0:0:0:0:(type+==+1)+||+(type+==+17)+||+(type+==+22)+||+(type+==+24)+||+(type+==+25)+||+(type+==+27)+||+(type+==+31)+ORDER+BY+name
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}

### bouqutes
GET http://vuuno4kse/api/bouquets
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}

### channels from bouquet
GET http://vuuno4kse/api/getallservices?type=radio
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}

